== Attacks and abilities ==
{{For|strategies for defeating Morgens|Aggressive creature strategies#Morgen}}
All Morgen attacks do friendly fire damage to [[Factions|allied creatures]]. Many of their attacks feature large movements — these movements shift the attack's hitbox with the user, extending their range. The impact of its jump attacks cause an area of effect hitbox which can be parried, with sufficient parry defense it will cancel the following dash. 

=== Bite ===
Jumps forward and bites down on the player (160 [[Damage types#Pierce|Pierce]], 100 Tier 3 [[Damage types#Chop|Chop]] and 100 Tier 3 [[Damage types#Pickaxe|Pickaxe]] damage). This attack creates a horizontal 4-meter 45-degree hitbox. It can be used every 4 seconds within 7 meters of a player.

=== Roll (right) ===
Morgens jump up and roll to their right upon landing (50 [[Damage types#Blunt|Blunt]], 100 Tier 3 [[Damage types#Chop|Chop]] and 100 Tier 3 [[Damage types#Pickaxe|Pickaxe]] damage). This attack hits in a 3-meter circular area around the user and can be used every 20 seconds<ref group="Note" name=":0">It is unknown why the left roll has a shorter cooldown than the right roll.</ref> within 12 meters of a player.

=== Roll (left) ===
Morgens jump up and roll to their left upon landing (50 [[Damage types#Blunt|Blunt]], 100 Tier 3 [[Damage types#Chop|Chop]] and 100 Tier 3 [[Damage types#Pickaxe|Pickaxe]] damage). This attack hits in a 3-meter circular area around the user and can be used every 12 seconds<ref group="Note" name=":0" /> within 12 meters of a player.

=== Swipe ===
This attack has four variations that each have their own 4-second cooldown: a right swipe, a left swipe, a right swipe followed by a left swipe, and a left swipe followed by a right swipe (160 [[Damage types#Blunt|Blunt]], 100 Tier 3 [[Damage types#Chop|Chop]] and 100 Tier 3 [[Damage types#Pickaxe|Pickaxe]] damage). These attacks can be used within 5 meters of a player, hitting in a 6-meter 60-degree horizontal arc.

=== Body slam ===
Stands upright and lift both arms up before slamming into the ground (160 [[Damage types#Blunt|Blunt]] damage). Morgens can attempt to use this attack every 12 seconds when within 5–12 meters of a player. It hits in a vertical arc 4 meters long, spanning 45 degrees.<ref group="Note">Due to a missing transition in the animator controller, this attack cannot actually be used, but Morgens will attempt to do so regardless. This causes them to pause briefly as if they are about to attack, but nothing will happen.</ref>

