== Notes ==
* There is no difference in appearance between the 0-star, 1-star and 2-star Morgen.

== Tips ==
* Ever since the rework of the [[Forsaken power|Forsaken Powers]], it is ill-advised to engage a 2-star Morgen, even with [[Flametal Armor|maxed armor]], maxed health, and a [[Flametal Shield|good shield]], as its attacks will override a block, unless the player has a very high [[Blocking (skill)|blocking]] [[Skills|skill]]. Parries are effective, but the damage from taking a hit, even with such drastic damage reduction, can nearly two-shot a player. 

